The horn should be fine, unless you're very unlucky (in real-world, not
game terms).  The first time you are made sick you have 20 + d(CON)-1
turns until you die.  Each time you're made sick the timeout is divided
by three and incremented by 1.  A blessed unicorn horn has a 77% chance
of curing illness if that's your only problem.  You would only have a
problem if the unicorn horn failed 3 or 4 times in a row (1% or less
chance), followed by a successful sickness attack each time.


